      "writtenOn": "2024-12-03T10:05:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You mean:\n```\n[Thread1] statsFetcher.get() --\u003e returns 42\n[Thread2] statsFetcher.get() --\u003e returns 43\n[Thread2] Caches 43\n[Thread1] putIfAbsent(42) -\u003e returns 42 --\u003e other method returns 43\n```\nRight?\n\nIt indeed fixes the out-of-order case but it would break the in-order case, which I think more likely to happen, right?\n```\n[Thread1] statsFetcher.get() --\u003e returns 42\n[Thread2] statsFetcher.get() --\u003e returns 43\n[Thread1] Caches 42\n[Thread2] putIfAbsent(43) -\u003e return 43 -\u003e other method returns 42. \n```\nIf so, prefer to keep it as is.\nWDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "b4a05215_750f58f8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1165,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 1167,
        "endChar": 38
